"Definition for Term 2, first paragraph. This is a continued line for the "
"first paragraph."
msgstr "用語2の定義、最初の段落。これは最初の段落の続きの行です。"

#: ../../source/contrib/tutorials/make_rst/basic_rst_content/basic_rst_content.rst:856
msgid "Second paragraph for definition of term 2."
msgstr "用語2の定義の2番目の段落。"

